00:15:12.945 --> 00:15:13.345
According to a witness,
the suspect is a mysterious woman,

00:15:13.345 --> 00:15:15.681
who's been shopping at the neighborhood
shopping arcade regularly,

00:15:15.681 --> 00:15:18.514
and she usually carries dangerous
objects in her shopping bag!

00:15:18.918 --> 00:15:20.052
What the...

00:15:20.052 --> 00:15:24.011
And this is composite sketch of the suspect
based on eyewitnesses accounts!

00:15:24.723 --> 00:15:25.958
WHAT?!

00:15:25.958 --> 00:15:27.760
That's Sunako, isn't it?

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:30.024
What's going on? Don't tell me...

00:15:30.462 --> 00:15:33.659
I'm gonna fatten you and eat you!

00:15:35.034 --> 00:15:37.025
There's no way in hell!

00:15:37.202 --> 00:15:41.440
What do we do? At this rate, they're
going to arrest Sunako for kidnapping!

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:44.643
You moron! Of course she's innocent.
Don't worry about it.

00:15:44.643 --> 00:15:47.237
But imagine her getting arrested in that outfit!

00:15:47.846 --> 00:15:49.905
You did it, didn't you?

00:15:51.684 --> 00:15:52.810
Say something!

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:57.853
Radiant! I wanna go back to the darkness!

00:15:59.391 --> 00:16:01.757
WAUGH!
Interrogation Room

00:16:02.728 --> 00:16:04.525
She's guilty for sure...

00:16:06.398 --> 00:16:08.093
Hey, wait a second!

00:16:09.001 --> 00:16:10.468
What's the matter, Noi?

00:16:10.836 --> 00:16:13.396
Sunako's wearing a dress, right?

00:16:13.672 --> 00:16:14.773
Yeah.

00:16:14.773 --> 00:16:16.308
What about it?

00:16:16.308 --> 00:16:19.607
Of course we're gonna go rescue her!
I've got an idea!

00:16:20.312 --> 00:16:21.814
Whisper, whisper, whisper, whisper...

00:16:21.814 --> 00:16:22.848
Mm, mm...

00:16:22.848 --> 00:16:24.583
Whisper, whisper, whisper, whisper...

00:16:24.583 --> 00:16:25.684
Mm, mm...

00:16:25.684 --> 00:16:28.620
What did you say?
Give me a break! Why ME?!

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:30.589
You know we can't just walk in
and take her out of there!

00:16:30.589 --> 00:16:33.592
We've got no choice if we want
to mystify the police!

00:16:33.592 --> 00:16:36.462
I'II call Auntie and ask her about the horse!

00:16:36.462 --> 00:16:38.731
I'II go to the costume room
and try to find a cape!

00:16:38.731 --> 00:16:40.899
Only you can do it, so just get over it.

00:16:40.899 --> 00:16:42.334
You've got to be kidding me!

00:16:42.334 --> 00:16:44.029
Sunako, hang in there!

00:16:44.937 --> 00:16:47.337
Reckless Willpower

00:16:50.609 --> 00:16:53.237
You have been completely surrounded!

00:16:53.879 --> 00:16:56.609
Give up and come out of there now!

00:16:56.782 --> 00:16:58.250
Yokkun!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:16:59.683
Please calm down, ma'am!

00:17:00.386 --> 00:17:03.753
Release the hostage immediately!

00:17:04.523 --> 00:17:06.759
What's all the commotion?

00:17:06.759 --> 00:17:10.496
It's almost dinner time. You should go home.

00:17:10.496 --> 00:17:12.297
Aren't you going home, lady?

00:17:12.297 --> 00:17:14.133
Don't worry about me.

00:17:14.133 --> 00:17:15.200
Okay...

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.998
Okay, see you tomorrow! Bye!

00:17:23.709 --> 00:17:27.236
I don't ever want to set foot outside...

00:17:30.015 --> 00:17:31.150
Yoshio!

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.846
The child! The hostage has been released!

00:17:34.386 --> 00:17:36.820
Yoshio! Yoshio! Yoshio!

00:17:37.389 --> 00:17:40.620
What's everyone gathered around for?

00:17:40.793 --> 00:17:44.163
What do you mean? I was so desperate
to have you released safely!

00:17:44.163 --> 00:17:45.697
What? Me?

00:17:45.697 --> 00:17:47.733
I was just playing inside my secret base!

00:17:47.733 --> 00:17:48.567
Huh?

00:17:48.567 --> 00:17:51.468
It looks like the police squad
is ready to move in!

00:17:51.937 --> 00:17:55.340
Get in there and take the suspect
into custody quickly!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:56.398
Yes, sir!

00:17:57.976 --> 00:17:59.773
What? What's that sound?

00:18:10.556 --> 00:18:11.557
A p-prince!

00:18:11.557 --> 00:18:12.956
A prince-nne!

00:18:16.395 --> 00:18:20.132
A prince! A horse! A white horse!

00:18:20.132 --> 00:18:21.759
A prince-nne! A horse-nne!

00:18:21.967 --> 00:18:23.836
B-Back off!

00:18:23.836 --> 00:18:26.839
Shut up! Why don't YOU move?

00:18:26.839 --> 00:18:28.966
You are obstructing the police
from performing their duties!

00:18:39.651 --> 00:18:42.381
I guess I do want to go home after all.

00:18:53.332 --> 00:18:54.799
Let's go home.

00:18:56.835 --> 00:18:58.769
Go... home?

00:18:59.104 --> 00:19:01.732
Yeah, we're going home.

00:19:05.944 --> 00:19:07.070
Huh?

00:19:09.815 --> 00:19:12.851
Radiant! Radiant!

00:19:12.851 --> 00:19:14.586
Shut up! Come on!

00:19:14.586 --> 00:19:16.255
No! You're too radiant!

00:19:16.255 --> 00:19:17.089
I said shut up!
No! You're too radiant!

00:19:17.089 --> 00:19:17.489
I said shut up!

00:19:17.489 --> 00:19:18.824
Look, here he comes!

00:19:18.824 --> 00:19:20.189
SIGH-nne!

00:19:21.193 --> 00:19:22.895
Are you all right, Princess?

00:19:22.895 --> 00:19:23.495
Princess..

00:19:23.495 --> 00:19:24.325
Princess!

00:19:34.573 --> 00:19:36.375
Come on, say the next line!

00:19:36.375 --> 00:19:39.572
Oh, right! A-Are y-you o-okay, P-Prince?

00:19:42.414 --> 00:19:44.041
Come on, next!

00:19:44.216 --> 00:19:46.318
What was my line again?

00:19:46.318 --> 00:19:50.189
Jeez! Can't you perform like you're supposed to?
You were supposed to memorize the script!

00:19:50.189 --> 00:19:52.624
H-Hey! Kyohei, you can't do that!

00:19:52.624 --> 00:19:54.960
She's the princess! You're supposed to
hold her like you'd hold a princess!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:58.828
Don't just carry her like a piece of luggage!
That won't work visually! It's just how it is!

00:20:00.365 --> 00:20:04.670
Damn, why are you so worked up over this?

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:06.900
Oh well, whatever... Come on, let's go!

00:20:07.873 --> 00:20:10.171
Certainly, my prince.

00:20:24.423 --> 00:20:26.558
Are they filming for a movie or something?

00:20:26.558 --> 00:20:30.255
They must be! You saw how beautifuI
those people were, right?

00:20:33.632 --> 00:20:35.834
Mission complete! Let's get out of here!

00:20:35.834 --> 00:20:36.630
Right!

00:20:37.269 --> 00:20:41.173
S-So many people are staring...

00:20:41.173 --> 00:20:45.777
I'm drawing their attention... No, no, no!

00:20:45.777 --> 00:20:48.746
Who cares what other people think?

00:20:50.215 --> 00:20:53.548
No matter what you wear
you're still you, right?

00:20:54.453 --> 00:20:57.911
It's none of their business.
As long as you like it, that's what counts.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:00.315
As long as I like it...

00:21:02.894 --> 00:21:07.297
It's like, you're scary no matter what you wear,
so it makes no difference!

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:10.102
Wow, that was fun!

00:21:10.102 --> 00:21:10.969
Yeah!

00:21:10.969 --> 00:21:13.939
Um, I don't know what to think of
that script, though...

00:21:13.939 --> 00:21:16.241
What? Why would you say that?

00:21:16.241 --> 00:21:19.335
It was good, wasn't it?
There were no problems!

00:21:20.112 --> 00:21:21.579
All right, all right.

00:21:23.248 --> 00:21:25.876
I'II never do this again, damn it!

00:21:27.686 --> 00:21:29.888
I'm so embarrassed! I just wanna die!

00:21:29.888 --> 00:21:31.723
I concur wholeheartedly.

00:21:31.723 --> 00:21:33.850
I don't wanna hear that from you!

00:21:38.397 --> 00:21:42.234
What happened to the curtain?! Where are
the spider webs? Where's the suit of armor?

00:21:42.234 --> 00:21:43.535
We returned them!

00:21:43.535 --> 00:21:46.402
Bah! I hate radiant rooms!

00:21:47.005 --> 00:21:50.275
She's okay in a dress,
but I feeI safer with her this way.

00:21:50.275 --> 00:21:52.402
We were so close though.

00:21:52.611 --> 00:21:54.374
Ugh, let's not talk about it.

